[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0010","text":"好热…………\n──啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0020","text":"没、没什么……\n只是觉得……热浪在摇晃呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0030","text":"真的耶～\n晃晃悠悠的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0040","text":"…………呐～\n那边的孩子，是不是迷路了呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0050","text":"诶……小小年纪一个人……？\n是跟父母走散了吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0060","text":"一个人肯定很困扰吧……\n要、要不要去搭话比较好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0070","text":"嗯～\n去看看吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0080","text":"咦……\n────消失了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0090","text":"消失了呢～？\n……那个孩子，就像小时候的小糸酱一样～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0100","text":"我、我觉得……\n有点像雏菜酱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200600_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
